# SEO guardrails

Follow [docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md](docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md) and [docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md](docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md).

- Site origin: `PUBLIC_SITE_URL` / `siteConfig.siteUrl` only (`src/config/site-origin.mjs` holds the workers.dev fallback). Never paste this site’s hostname into pages or scripts.
- Titles ≤60; meta description 50–165; one H1; answer-first 40–60 words on home/tools/guides.
- `/sitemap.xml` must **301** to `/sitemap-index.xml` (not 200).
- Worker file extension allowlist up to 16 chars (`.webmanifest`).
- Every tool page links ≥1 topical guide; guides ≥800 words; topic-matched related links.
- og:image absolute and must not end with `/`.
- No `import` in classic inline scripts; no IndexNow placeholder keys; no `example.com` in dist.
- `npm run audit:seo` must stay green.
